WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,360
Forget it, I won’t save you either

2
00:00:01,360 --> 00:00:03,440
Just stay where you are and be rubbed by reality.

3
00:00:03,440 --> 00:00:04,440
A monthly salary of 30,000

4
00:00:04,440 --> 00:00:05,760
I will also be allocated a house with 31 living rooms.

5
00:00:05,760 --> 00:00:06,880
Why do you need a maternity certificate for ten years?

6
00:00:06,880 --> 00:00:08,400
I have never seen such a arrogant company in my life.

7
00:00:08,400 --> 00:00:11,000
As long as you can get in, it's worth it if you work hard.

8
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:12,320
Thank you to everyone who traveled thousands of miles to participate

9
00:00:12,320 --> 00:00:13,480
Interview at Tianbao Auction House

10
00:00:13,480 --> 00:00:14,920
But there are too many people here today

11
00:00:14,920 --> 00:00:16,440
Let’s do the first round of rough selection first

12
00:00:16,440 --> 00:00:18,440
Retired Special Forces Processing

13
00:00:18,440 --> 00:00:20,800
It’s not like we don’t give others a chance if any of you

14
00:00:20,800 --> 00:00:22,400
Some people can lift more than 300 kilograms of weight

15
00:00:22,400 --> 00:00:23,680
